{"sources":1125,"surfaces":6254,"risk_candidates":[{"file":"packages/daemon-core/src/daemon/HandshakeManager.ts","line":202,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`Handshake file deleted: ${handshakeFile}`","owner":"removeHandshake"},{"file":"packages/daemon-core/src/tools/handlers/sf-artifact-write.ts","line":1130,"kind":"MESSAGE_FIELD","expression":"'Project configuration may only be established during intake_ready. Recover the same Work Item to the legal intake boundary instead of bypassing Write Guard.'","owner":"callback"},{"file":"packages/permission-engine/src/hard-rules.ts","line":75,"kind":"MESSAGE_FIELD","expression":"'Agent must not bypass Gate checks'","owner":"module"},{"file":"packages/service-management/src/errors/service-error.ts","line":171,"kind":"MESSAGE_FIELD","expression":"() => 'Preserve the failure and rollback logs. Inspect installation verification and the owning installation/recovery operation before retrying; do not manually delete runtime state, locks or user data.'","owner":"module"},{"file":"packages/service-management/src/errors/service-error.ts","line":171,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"'Preserve the failure and rollback logs. Inspect installation verification and the owning installation/recovery operation before retrying; do not manually delete runtime state, locks or user data.'","owner":"callback"},{"file":"scripts/lib/daemon-http-reference.ts","line":30,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`# Current Daemon HTTP routes\\n\\nDerived from [HTTPServer](../src/http/HTTPServer.ts) and the controlled HTTP tool registry. Regenerate with \\`bun scripts/render-daemon-http-reference.ts\\`; check with \\`--check\\`. Product authority remains [SPS](../../../docs/product-specification/specforge-product-specification.md).\\n","owner":"renderDaemonHttpReferences"},{"file":"scripts/lib/downgrade.ts","line":108,"kind":"MESSAGE_FIELD","expression":"`Downgrade detected: ${check.previousVersion} → ${check.targetVersion}. Use --force to proceed.`","owner":"evaluateDowngradeGate"},{"file":"scripts/lib/executor.ts","line":152,"kind":"MESSAGE_FIELD","expression":"`Conflict: file \"${entry.relativePath}\" has been customized by user. Use --force to overwrite.`","owner":"executeConflict"},{"file":"scripts/lib/opencode_merge.ts","line":379,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`跳过 Agent \"${name}\": 不在 managed_agents 中，可能是用户自定义。使用 --force 覆盖`","owner":"mergeOpenCodeJsonUserLevel"},{"file":"scripts/lib/planner.ts","line":278,"kind":"MESSAGE_FIELD","expression":"`${decision.reason} — resolved to update by --force flag`","owner":"generatePlan"},{"file":"scripts/lib/verify.ts","line":396,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`   建议: 核对并保存需要保留的受管文件改动后，执行 \\`bun scripts/sf-installer.ts upgrade --force\\` 重新复制当前发布清单中的受管项，再运行 verify；不要手改 Manifest`","owner":"printVerifyReport"},{"file":"scripts/scan-host-profile.ts","line":71,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`\nHost Profile 扫描器 — 探测宿主机环境并写入 <OpenCode config>/sf-user/host-profile.json\n\n用法:\n  bun run scripts/scan-host-profile.ts [选项]\n\n选项:\n  --force, -f       强制重新扫描，忽略 30 天缓存\n  --show, -s        显示当前档案（不扫描）\n  --check           CI 模式：扫描后输出 JSON 摘要到 stdout\n  --quiet, -q       静默模式（不打印进度）\n  --help, -h        显示本帮助\n\n档案位置:\n  ${getH","owner":"showHelp"},{"file":"scripts/sf-installer.ts","line":110,"kind":"THROW","expression":"new InstallerError(InstallerErrorCode.E_INVALID_JSON, \"--force 仅适用于 upgrade，不授予其他操作或权限\")","owner":"parseArgs"},{"file":"scripts/sf-installer.ts","line":110,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"\"--force 仅适用于 upgrade，不授予其他操作或权限\"","owner":"parseArgs"},{"file":"scripts/sf-installer.ts","line":120,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`\nSpecForge 安装器 — 用户级共享组件管理\n\n用法:\n  bun scripts/sf-installer.ts <subcommand> [options]\n\n子命令:\n  install           部署共享组件到 OpenCode 配置目录\n  upgrade           原子升级共享组件\n  verify            校验共享组件完整性（SHA-256）\n  uninstall         卸载共享组件\n\n选项:\n  --force     仅 upgrade：重新复制 release manifest 中的受管文件，包括清单版本未变化的文件\n  --version   显示已安装的","owner":"showUsage"}]}
